#: en/live-config.7:412
msgid "I<live-tools>(7)"
msgstr "I<live-tools>(7)"

#. type: SH
#: en/live-config.7:413
#, no-wrap
msgid "HOMEPAGE"
msgstr "ДОМАШНЯЯ СТРАНИЦА"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:415
msgid ""
"More information about MiniOS live-config can be found at E<lt>I<https://"
"github.com/minios-linux/minios-live-config>E<gt>. Information about the "
"upstream Debian Live project is available at E<lt>I<https://wiki.debian.org/"
"DebianLive>E<gt>."
msgstr ""
"Дополнительную информацию о MiniOS live-config можно найти по адресу "
"E<lt>I<https://github.com/minios-linux/minios-live-config>E<gt>. Сведения о "
"проекте Debian Live доступны по адресу E<lt>I<https://wiki.debian.org/"
"DebianLive>E<gt>."

#. type: SH
#: en/live-config.7:416
#, no-wrap
msgid "BUGS"
msgstr "ОШИБКИ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:418
msgid ""
"Bugs can be reported at E<lt>I<https://github.com/minios-linux/minios-live-"
"config/issues>E<gt>."
msgstr ""
"Сообщить об ошибках можно по адресу E<lt>I<https://github.com/minios-linux/"
"minios-live-config/issues>E<gt>."

#. type: SH
#: en/live-config.7:419
#, no-wrap
msgid "AUTHOR"
msgstr "АВТОР"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:420
msgid ""
"live-config was originally written by Daniel Baumann E<lt>I<mail@daniel-"
"baumann.ch>E<gt>. Since 2016 development has been continued by the Debian "
"Live team. Since 2025 development of the modified version has been continued "
"by the MiniOS Live team."
msgstr ""
"Изначально live-config был написан Даниэлем Бауманом E<lt>I<mail@daniel-"
"baumann.ch>E<gt>. С 2016 года разработка продолжается командой Debian Live. "
"С 2025 года разработка модифицированной версии продолжается командой MiniOS "
"Live."
